values ('technofast-blue-rhino-electric-tensioner-pumps', 'Blue Rhino', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-pumps'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'Blue Rhino 전동 유압 텐셔너 펌프', 'Blue Rhino Electric-Hydraulic Tensioner Pumps', '가혹한 현장과 높은 듀티 사이클을 위해 설계된 고유량 전동 유압 텐셔너 펌프입니다.', 'The Blue Rhino series of electric hydraulic pumps is engineered to deliver reliable, high-pressure power for critical hydraulic bolt tensioning applications in harsh field conditions.', 'Blue Rhino는 산업용 전동 모터, 비상 정지 기능이 있는 저전압 핸드 펜던트, 보호 프레임과 고급 여과 시스템을 갖춥니다. 오일 쿨러, 디지털 게이지, 대용량 탱크와 수글리콜 호환 옵션을 선택할 수 있습니다.', 'The Blue Rhino series of electric hydraulic pumps is engineered to deliver reliable, high-pressure power for critical hydraulic bolt tensioning applications in harsh field conditions. Designed specifically to excel under unstable site conditions, each robust electric hydraulic pump provides the extreme precision required to eliminate the variables of traditional torquing methods. Built for maximum durability, these high-performance tensioner pumps feature low-voltage tolerance, are cycle-tested for industrial endurance, and are capable of reaching operating pressures up to 30,000 psi. Whether executing complex wind turbine assembly or heavy industrial plant maintenance, the Blue Rhino series ensures safe, efficient, and highly predictable joint clamping. Features: Industrial Electric Motor : Built with a robust motor designed to handle heat and low voltage challenges. Low-Voltage Hand Pendant : Features a control circuit with an integrated Emergency Stop button located directly on the pendant. Standard Protective Frame : Supplied with an external frame to protect the unit from rough handling. Advanced Filtration : Equipped with a filtration system designed to protect the internal hydraulics from contamination. Optimised Hydraulic Circuit : Engineered to generate less heat and support system life. Compact Design : Built with a low overall weight and size profile, featuring controls configured for bolting operations. Configurable Product Options : Available with optional oil coolers, digital gauges, larger reservoir sizes, higher horsepower models, and water-glycol fluid compatibility. Benefits: Operator Safety : Reduces electrical hazards during operation by utilizing a low-voltage control circuit on the hand pendant. Verified Reliability : Performance and reliability are verified before deployment through rigourous cycle testing on every unit. Component Longevity : The combination of advanced filtration and a low-heat hydraulic circuit helps protect the system against dirt, wear, and thermal degradation. Increased Flow Speed : Higher motor horsepower provides more flow at working pressure to support the efficiency of bolt tensioning tasks. On-Site Handling : The compact size and low weight make the unit easier for operators to transport and position in demanding environments. Application Flexibility : The available options allow the pump system to be configured for higher-pressure requirements up to 30,000 psi or double-acting tensioner circuits on request.',
  '{"drive_type": "Industrial electric motor", "pressure_range_bar": "Up to 2068 (30,000 psi option)", "reservoir_capacity_l": "Configurable", "flow_rate_lpm": "High-flow configuration available", "weight_range_kg": "Compact portable frame"}'::jsonb, true, 4910, 'blue rhino 전동 유압 텐셔너 펌프 blue rhino electric-hydraulic tensioner pumps 가혹한 현장과 높은 듀티 사이클을 위해 설계된 고유량 전동 유압 텐셔너 펌프입니다. the blue rhino series of electric hydraulic pumps is engineered to deliver reliable, high-pressure power for critical hydraulic bolt tensioning applications in harsh field conditions. blue rhino technofast industries technofast 고압 유압 펌프 technofast high-pressure hydraulic pumps industrial electric motor up to 2068 (30,000 psi option) configurable high-flow configuration available compact portable frame')
