values ('technofast-camnut', 'CamNut H1/H2', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-nuts'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'CamNut H1/H2 텐셔닝 시스템', 'CamNut', '짧은 볼트 돌출부와 -40~650°C 환경에서 사용하는 모듈형 직접 텐셔닝 너트입니다.', 'The CamNut EziJac is an innovative hydraulic bolt tensioning nut engineered to provide accurate, reliable clamping loads on components where traditional fasteners fail.', 'CamNut은 기존 육각 너트를 대체해 별도 유압 텐셔너의 직접 연결점이 되며, OEM 볼트와 스폿 페이스를 변경하지 않고 정밀 텐셔닝을 구현합니다. H1은 표준 고온 설비, H2는 최대 650°C의 극한 환경에 대응합니다.', 'The CamNut EziJac is an innovative hydraulic bolt tensioning nut engineered to provide accurate, reliable clamping loads on components where traditional fasteners fail. This high-performance CamNut EziJac tensioning system is specifically designed for applications where standard stud lengths do not leave enough protruding thread for conventional tensioner tools to grip. By utilising a specialised internal mechanism, the CamNut EziJac solves the common industrial challenge of short grip lengths, eliminating the need for expensive, time-consuming stud replacements across heavy machinery joints Features: Zero Thread Protrusion Needed : Fits directly onto existing studs with no available exposed thread above the nut, eliminating costly stud extensions. Rapid Installation Cycle : Designed for incredibly fast tool fitting and removal sequences, dramatically improving maintenance loop efficiency. Extreme Temperature Resilience : Built from premium high-tensile alloys to operate reliably across severe thermal parameters from –40°C up to +650°C.Modular, Lightweight Construction : Utilises a smart multi-piece design that separates individual component weights to minimise physical lifting stress. Benefits: Eliminates Stud Replacement Costs : Saves substantial capital outlays by tensioning original, short-grip fasteners without requiring longer replacement studs. Reduces Plant Downtime : Speeds up major turnarounds via intuitive operation, swift pressure engagement, and immediate tool breakdown. Prevents Operator Handling Injuries : Eliminates pinch points and heavy striking tool hazards, drastically decreasing potential worker safety incidents. Reliable First-Time Tensioning : Bypasses up to 90% of thread friction losses to guarantee a uniform, predictable, and leak-free joint seal from the first pull. Ideal applications: Short Stud Clearances : Tensioning critical mechanical joints where there is insufficient thread protrusion for standard hydraulic tensioners. Severe Thermal Cycling : Secures heavy-duty high-temperature connections operating in environments ranging from –40°C up to +650°C. High-Vibration Machinery : Preventing loosening on large-diameter fasteners subjected to continuous operational or vibrational stresses. Frequent Maintenance Routines : Speeding up procedures on industrial components requiring repeated, rapid tool adjustments or frequent nut removals.',
  '{"thread_range": "1.75-6 in", "max_force_kn": 7088.87, "temperature_range": "-40°C to +650°C"}'::jsonb, true, 4920, 'camnut h1/h2 텐셔닝 시스템 camnut 짧은 볼트 돌출부와 -40~650°c 환경에서 사용하는 모듈형 직접 텐셔닝 너트입니다. the camnut ezijac is an innovative hydraulic bolt tensioning nut engineered to provide accurate, reliable clamping loads on components where traditional fasteners fail. camnut h1/h2 technofast industries technofast 유압 너트 technofast hydraulic nuts 1.75-6 in 7088.87 -40°c to +650°c')
