values ('technofast-ezijac-b2', 'EziJac B2 Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-bolt-tensioners'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziJac B2 전용형 유압 볼트 텐셔너', 'B2 EziJac Bolt Tensioner', '각 볼트 규격에 최적화된 1,500 bar 전용형 수동 복귀 텐셔너입니다.', 'The B2 Series is a manual return EziJac which is part of our dedicated series of tools that each tool is designed to tension 1 bolt sizes.', 'B2 시리즈는 특정 볼트 크기와 나사에 맞춘 경제적인 전용 텐셔너입니다. 컴팩트한 본체, 저마찰 씰, 스트로크 표시기와 선택형 두 번째 포트를 갖추며 여러 공구를 연결해 플랜지를 동시에 균일하게 텐셔닝할 수 있습니다.', 'The B2 Series is a manual return EziJac which is part of our dedicated series of tools that each tool is designed to tension 1 bolt sizes. The B2 EziJac Stud Tensioner utilizes the power of hydraulic pressure to produce the force necessary to tension bolts and studs accurately & safely. The B2 EziJac Dedicated Stud Tensioners provide the answer to many of the fitting problems associated with using larger tensioning equipment. They are also ideal for single task applications which do not require interchangeability of thread sizes. Any number of B2 EziJacs can be interlinked to provide simultaneous tension over multiple studs or bolts as required. Features: Stroke Indicator. Long Stroke. Leak-free Low-friction seals. Nitrided components to increase the tool life. Manual return. Optional second port. Quality assured. Benefits: Reduces maintenance down time. Improves safety on the job by eliminating hammer tightening. Give reliable and precise tensioning. Is user friendly - fast to fit and remove. Requires little physical effort. Ideal for confined spaces or difficult locations. Ideal applications: Accurate and repeatable loading is required. Irrational or torsional stresses are a problem. Regular maintenance requires repeated adjustments or removal of nuts. Confined and difficult nut locations. Simultaneous tensioning of bolts is required. (eg: Flanges)',
  '{"thread_range": "M24-M100 / 7/8-4 in", "max_force_kn": 4605.3, "max_pressure_bar": 1500, "stroke_mm": "15", "return_type": "Manual return", "configuration": "Dedicated tool"}'::jsonb, true, 4930, 'ezijac b2 전용형 유압 볼트 텐셔너 b2 ezijac bolt tensioner 각 볼트 규격에 최적화된 1,500 bar 전용형 수동 복귀 텐셔너입니다. the b2 series is a manual return ezijac which is part of our dedicated series of tools that each tool is designed to tension 1 bolt sizes. ezijac b2 series technofast industries technofast 볼트 텐셔너 technofast bolt tensioners m24-m100 / 7/8-4 in 4605.3 1500 15 manual return dedicated tool')
