values ('technofast-ezijac-b3m', 'EziJac B3M Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-bolt-tensioners'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziJac B3M 모듈식 볼트 텐셔너', 'B3M EziJac Bolt Tensioner', '교체식 어댑터 키트와 수동 복귀 구조를 갖춘 모듈식 유압 볼트 텐셔너입니다.', 'The B3M Series is a MANUAL return EziJac which is part of our modular series allowing multiple adaptor kits to be interchanged with the one load cell.', 'B3M은 하나의 로드 셀에 여러 교체식 어댑터를 결합하여 다양한 나사 크기에 대응합니다. 긴 스트로크, 스트로크 표시기, 저마찰 씰 및 선택형 두 번째 포트로 정확한 다점 동시 체결을 지원합니다.', 'The B3M Series is a MANUAL return EziJac which is part of our modular series allowing multiple adaptor kits to be interchanged with the one load cell. Safe Easy to Operate Manual Return Accurate Bolt Tensioning The EziJac uses hydraulic pressure to tension the bolt to the exact load required. Once the bolt has been tensioned, the nut is wound down the thread to retain the load. The EziJac is then de-pressurised, released and ready to use again. Features: Stroke indicator. Long Stroke. Interchangeable Adaptor Kits. Leak-free Lo-friction seals. Nitrided components to increase the tool life. Optional second port. Quality assured. Benefits: Reduce assembly time for critical jointing applications. Multi-point tensioning for even gasket compression. Reduced labour input. Requires little physical effort. Improves safety on the job by eliminating hammer tightening. No pinch points, unlike power wrenches. Remote pumping, no operators in close work area. User friendly; fast to fit and remove. Ideal applications: Accurate and repeatable loading is required. Irrational or torsional stresses are a problem. Regular maintenance requires repeated adjustments or removal of nuts. Confined and difficult nut locations. Simultaneous tensioning of bolts is required. (eg: Flanges',
  '{"thread_range": "M20-M100 / 3/4-4 in", "max_pressure_bar": 1500, "stroke_mm": "15", "return_type": "Manual return", "configuration": "Modular interchangeable adaptor kits"}'::jsonb, true, 4940, 'ezijac b3m 모듈식 볼트 텐셔너 b3m ezijac bolt tensioner 교체식 어댑터 키트와 수동 복귀 구조를 갖춘 모듈식 유압 볼트 텐셔너입니다. the b3m series is a manual return ezijac which is part of our modular series allowing multiple adaptor kits to be interchanged with the one load cell. ezijac b3m series technofast industries technofast 볼트 텐셔너 technofast bolt tensioners m20-m100 / 3/4-4 in 1500 15 manual return modular interchangeable adaptor kits')
