values ('technofast-ezijac-b3s', 'EziJac B3S Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-bolt-tensioners'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziJac B3S 모듈형 스프링 리턴 텐셔너', 'B3S EziJac Bolt Tensioner', '교체식 어댑터 키트와 자동 스프링 리턴을 갖춘 1,500 bar 모듈형 텐셔너입니다.', 'The B3S Series is an AUTOMATIC spring return EziJac Bolt Tensioner which is part of our modular series allowing multiple adaptor kits to be interchanged with the one load cell. SAFE. EASY TO OPERATE. SPRING RETURN. ENSURES ACCURATE BOLT TENSIONING.', 'B3S는 하나의 로드 셀에 여러 어댑터 키트를 조합하는 모듈형 텐셔너입니다. 감압 시 스프링이 피스톤을 자동 복귀시키며, 원격 펌핑과 다중 공구 연결을 통해 작업자를 위험 구역에서 분리하고 플랜지를 균일하게 체결합니다.', 'The B3S Series is an AUTOMATIC spring return EziJac Bolt Tensioner which is part of our modular series allowing multiple adaptor kits to be interchanged with the one load cell. SAFE. EASY TO OPERATE. SPRING RETURN. ENSURES ACCURATE BOLT TENSIONING. The EziJac uses hydraulic pressure to tension the bolt to the exact load required. Once the bolt has been tensioned, the nut is wound down the thread to retain the load. The EziJac is then de-pressurised, released and ready to use again. Features: Stroke indicator. Long Stroke. Spring return piston. Interchangeable Adaptor Kits. Leak-free Lo-friction seals. Nitrided components to increase the tool life. Optional second port. Quality assured. Benefits: Reduce assembly time for critical jointing applications. Multi-point tensioning for even gasket compression. Reduced labour input. Requires little physical effort. Improves safety on the job by eliminating hammer tightening. No pinch points, unlike power wrenches. Remote pumping, no operators in close work area. User friendly; fast to fit and remove. Spring Return models for automatic retraction. Ideal applications: Accurate and repeatable loading is required. Irrational or torsional stresses are a problem. Regular maintenance requires repeated adjustments or removal of nuts. Confined and difficult nut locations. Simultaneous tensioning of bolts is required. (eg: Flanges)',
  '{"thread_range": "M24-M100 / 7/8-4 in", "max_force_kn": 4929, "max_pressure_bar": 1500, "stroke_mm": "15", "return_type": "Automatic spring return", "configuration": "B3S-L2 to B3S-L12 modular load cells"}'::jsonb, true, 4950, 'ezijac b3s 모듈형 스프링 리턴 텐셔너 b3s ezijac bolt tensioner 교체식 어댑터 키트와 자동 스프링 리턴을 갖춘 1,500 bar 모듈형 텐셔너입니다. the b3s series is an automatic spring return ezijac bolt tensioner which is part of our modular series allowing multiple adaptor kits to be interchanged with the one load cell. safe. easy to operate. spring return. ensures accurate bolt tensioning. ezijac b3s series technofast industries technofast 볼트 텐셔너 technofast bolt tensioners m24-m100 / 7/8-4 in 4929 1500 15 automatic spring return b3s-l2 to b3s-l12 modular load cells')
