values ('technofast-ezijac-x2-y2', 'EziJac X2 & Y2 Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-bolt-tensioners'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziJac X2/Y2 2단 볼트 텐셔너', 'Y2 & X2 – 2 Stage Tensioning', '협소 공간에서 높은 텐셔닝 힘을 제공하는 슬림형 2단 스프링 리턴 텐셔너입니다.', 'Technofast’s X2 & Y2 2-Stage EziJacs encompass a large range of slim bodied tensioners to complete maintenance on any application with restricted space.', 'X2/Y2 시리즈는 표준 공구가 들어가지 않는 좁은 공간을 위한 다단 텐셔너입니다. 자동 스프링 복귀, 오버스트로크 방지, 스트로크 표시기와 선택형 1/2인치 소켓 구동 기어를 적용해 제한된 접근 조건에서도 안전하고 정확하게 작업합니다.', 'Technofast’s X2 & Y2 2-Stage EziJacs encompass a large range of slim bodied tensioners to complete maintenance on any application with restricted space. The 2-Stage series of hydraulic Tensioners are a lightweight, user friendly range of Tensioners, which are quickly and easily fitted in restricted spaces. These Tensioners are powerful & provide accurate and versatile tensioning of bolts and studs whilst being fast, simple and safe to use. Features: Stroke Indicator. Long Stroke. Spring return piston. Over stroke prevetion. Slim fit design. Leak-free Lo-friction seals. Nitrided components. Optional side gear box. Quality assured. Technofast''s X2 and Y2 Multistage Bolt Tensioners may be fitted with an optional Gear Drive to rotate the retaining nut without the use of a Pin Spanner. The drive is operated using a standard 1/2" socket wrench. The feature optimises the speed of operation and allows the tools to be used in restricted spaces where a Pin Spanner drive could not be employed. An Integral idler gear is used to ensure that the drive tool and nut rotations are in the same direction.',
  '{"thread_range": "Custom to application", "return_type": "Automatic spring return", "configuration": "Slim two-stage X2 and Y2"}'::jsonb, true, 4960, 'ezijac x2/y2 2단 볼트 텐셔너 y2 & x2 – 2 stage tensioning 협소 공간에서 높은 텐셔닝 힘을 제공하는 슬림형 2단 스프링 리턴 텐셔너입니다. technofast’s x2 & y2 2-stage ezijacs encompass a large range of slim bodied tensioners to complete maintenance on any application with restricted space. ezijac x2 & y2 series technofast industries technofast 볼트 텐셔너 technofast bolt tensioners custom to application automatic spring return slim two-stage x2 and y2')
