values ('technofast-ezitite-hydraulic-bolt', 'EziTite Hydraulic Bolt', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-nuts'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziTite 유압 볼트', 'EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts', '진동과 충격 하중에 강하고 비틀림 없이 하중을 유지하는 일체형 유압 볼트입니다.', 'EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts: Precision Hydraulic Fasteners for Heavy Industry EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts are precision-engineered, high-performance, hydraulically operated fasteners that incorporate advanced mechanisms for direct bolt tensioning .', 'EziTite 유압 볼트는 일반 체결재를 대체하는 유압 텐셔닝 일체형 볼트입니다. 유압으로 볼트를 신장한 후 고유 잠금 링이 하중을 유지하므로 나사 갈링과 비틀림 응력을 방지하며, 진동 스크린, 기초 볼트, 배관 플랜지 및 반응기 조인트에 적합합니다.', 'EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts: Precision Hydraulic Fasteners for Heavy Industry EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts are precision-engineered, high-performance, hydraulically operated fasteners that incorporate advanced mechanisms for direct bolt tensioning . These specialised fasteners minimise the time required to execute critical bolting procedures while delivering extreme resistance to vibration and shock loads. Manufactured from high-grade alloy or stainless steels to meet exact application requirements, they can be rapidly fitted and pressurised using standard pumping equipment, including Technofast hand-operated, electric-hydraulic, or air-hydraulic pumps . What Are EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts? Standard torque tightening relies on friction, which can lead to inaccurate joint loading. In contrast, EziTite® Hydraulic Bolts utilise direct hydraulic pressure to eliminate friction guesswork entirely. These high-tensile fasteners feature a unique lockring thread technology that mechanically secures the stretched bolt, ensuring maximum retained load across critical joints. To accommodate complex industrial operating environments, they are available with optional protective covers, specialised surface treatments, and custom-designed seal profiles to match distinct temperature and pressure profiles. Features: Diameter Range : Available in standard sizes from 20mm (7/8”) up to 100mm (4”) bolt diameters Lockring Thread : Uses mechanical thread technology to secure and lock the retained load Spherical Washer : Supplied as standard to ensure proper alignment with the joint face Standard Fittings : Pre-fitted with CEJN-type male snap fittings and 1/8″ BSPP porting Pressure Capacity : Rated up to a maximum pressure of 100 MPa for standard models Stroke Indicator : Built-in visual indicator to monitor bolt elongation during tensioning Bleed Plugs: Integrated into the assembly for safe, controlled pressure release Material Options : Manufactured from alloy or stainless steels based on application demands Benefits: Vibration Resistance : Eliminates fastening failure on machinery subjected to heavy shock loads Frictionless Loading : Removes the torque-loss guesswork by stretching the bolt axially Time Savings : Minimises labor hours required to secure or open critical industrial joints Confined Access : Enables reliable tightening in tight, restricted, or awkward physical locations Repeatable Maintenance : Simplifies regular inspections where repeated adjustments are required Custom Engineering : Scalable beyond standard limits for unique temperature or pressure needs Pump Compatibility : Operates seamlessly with standard hand, electric, or air-hydraulic pumps. Ideal applications: Precise Pre-loading : Ideal when highly accurate and reliable loading is required on bolting assemblies Stress Management : Engineered for joints where severe vibrational or torsional stresses pose a problem Repeated Access : Maximises efficiency where regular maintenance requires repeated adjustment or removal of fasteners Restricted Access : Built specifically for environments where fasteners may be in confined or difficult locations Heavy Processing Machinery : Highly suited for securing vibrating screens and sieves High-Pressure Containment : Purpose-built for critical piping flanges, reactor joints, and vessel covers Heavy Infrastructure : Perfectly configured for anchoring autoclaves and structural foundation bolts.',
  '{"thread_range": "20-100 mm standard range", "max_pressure_bar": 1000, "material": "Alloy steel or stainless steel"}'::jsonb, true, 4980, 'ezitite 유압 볼트 ezitite® hydraulic bolts 진동과 충격 하중에 강하고 비틀림 없이 하중을 유지하는 일체형 유압 볼트입니다. ezitite® hydraulic bolts: precision hydraulic fasteners for heavy industry ezitite® hydraulic bolts are precision-engineered, high-performance, hydraulically operated fasteners that incorporate advanced mechanisms for direct bolt tensioning . ezitite hydraulic bolt technofast industries technofast 유압 너트 technofast hydraulic nuts 20-100 mm standard range 1000 alloy steel or stainless steel')
