values ('technofast-ezitite-hydraulic-clamp-nut', 'EziTite Hydraulic Clamp Nut', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-nuts'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziTite 유압 클램프 너트', 'EziTite® Hydraulic Clamp Nut', '50~300 mm 축 나사에 정밀하고 반복 가능한 공구 클램핑력을 제공하는 유압 너트입니다.', 'The EziTite® Hydraulic Clamp Nut replaces conventional torque-loaded threaded fasteners to transform industrial shaft tensioning and precise bearing setting into a simple, safe, and efficient hydraulically assisted operation.', '토크 방식 너트를 대체하여 유압으로 지정된 클램핑력을 적용하고 잠금 링으로 하중을 유지합니다. 대형 축 베어링과 회전 충격이 있는 공구 클램핑에서 제품 편차와 정비 시간을 줄이도록 설계되었습니다.', 'The EziTite® Hydraulic Clamp Nut replaces conventional torque-loaded threaded fasteners to transform industrial shaft tensioning and precise bearing setting into a simple, safe, and efficient hydraulically assisted operation. By providing repeatable tensioning accuracy, this advanced hydraulic clamp nut system eliminates product variation, vastly reduces maintenance downtime, and extends overall tool life across demanding environments. Manufactured in an extensive standard range to suit thread sizes from 50 mm to 300 mm, with custom design dimensions available on request, the EziTite® series ensures reliable loading parameters without compromising component or product quality. Features: Threaded Locking Collar : Features an integrated mechanical ring that effectively counteracts the severe loosening forces of impact on rotating shafts. Vastly Reduces Downtime : Minimises complex maintenance problems on-site, directly leading to improved plant productivity and faster processing throughput. User-Friendly Architecture : Exceptionally fast and easy to fit by hand, helping operations achieve an optimised tool lifecycle with minimal manual labor. Mitigates Mechanical Risk : Minimises the hazard of personal injury and severe collateral damage to capital equipment during high-risk blade and tool changes. Exceptional Repeatable Accuracy : Standardises the precision of your shaft tensioning sequences, which drastically slashes structural variations across final product runs. Benefits: Accurate Hydraulic Loading : Delivers precise, predictable force distribution directly to the joint, completely bypassing the extreme energy losses common to torque. Positive Locking Ring : Relies on a heavy-duty mechanical ring collar to positively lock and retain the fully calculated tension load permanently in place. Eliminates Primitive Tooling : Completely replaces outdated, high-risk lug wrench and striking hammer tightening methods to protect delicate machinery faces. Maximises Worker Safety : Substantially increases operator safety parameters while decreasing workplace injury potential inside tight, restrictive machinery areas Ideal applications: Precision Tool Loading : Demanding applications where highly accurate, uniform, and thoroughly reliable loading forces are required on critical machine bolting layouts. High-Vibration Environments : Industrial environments where severe vibrational, rotational, or torsional stresses present a continuous threat to fastener security. Frequent Fastener Adjustments : Busy production schedules where regular plant maintenance requires repeated adjustments or the rapid, frequent removal of joint nuts. Restricted Workspace Layouts : Confined, high-load machinery spaces or awkward locations where difficult nut positioning severely restricts standard tooling access. Heavy Rotating Shafts : Executing swift blade, tool, or cutter alterations on industrial rotating axles without risking misalignment or loose components',
  '{"thread_range": "50-300 mm", "material": "Application-specific alloy construction"}'::jsonb, true, 4990, 'ezitite 유압 클램프 너트 ezitite® hydraulic clamp nut 50~300 mm 축 나사에 정밀하고 반복 가능한 공구 클램핑력을 제공하는 유압 너트입니다. the ezitite® hydraulic clamp nut replaces conventional torque-loaded threaded fasteners to transform industrial shaft tensioning and precise bearing setting into a simple, safe, and efficient hydraulically assisted operation. ezitite hydraulic clamp nut technofast industries technofast 유압 너트 technofast hydraulic nuts 50-300 mm application-specific alloy construction')
