values ('technofast-ezitite-hydraulic-head-nut', 'EziTite Hydraulic Head Nut', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-nuts'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziTite 유압 헤드 너트', 'EziTite® Hydraulic Head Nut', '자이러토리 크러셔 맨틀을 해머 없이 안전하게 장착·분리하는 유압 헤드 너트입니다.', 'The EziTite® Hydraulic Head Nut by Technofast Industries replaces standard mantle head nuts on gyratory crushers, delivering a precise and significantly safer tightening solution for the quarrying industry.', '크러셔 축에 손으로 체결한 뒤 유압으로 맨틀을 테이퍼에 정확히 안착시키고 기계식 잠금 스크류 또는 링으로 하중을 유지합니다. 해머 타격과 화염 절단을 제거하며 마모 환경에 맞춘 희생 커버를 적용할 수 있습니다.', 'The EziTite® Hydraulic Head Nut by Technofast Industries replaces standard mantle head nuts on gyratory crushers, delivering a precise and significantly safer tightening solution for the quarrying industry. The design eliminates the manual hammering methods that commonly cause operator strike or shrapnel injuries. Precise clamping forces are generated via hydraulic pressure and securely held by mechanical locking rings. Built for harsh processing environments, the nut includes an integrated sacrificial protective cover customized to match the abrasive nature of the material being crushed. Features: Hydraulic Clamping Nut: Generates precise clamping forces by hydraulic pressure acting on a constrained area within the assembly Mechanical Locking Rings/Screws: Fitted to the assembly to retain tensile loads Integral Sacrificial Protective Cover: Can be constructed according to the abrasive nature of the material being crushed Threaded Locking Collar: Counteracts loosening forces of impact on rotating shafts Nipple Fitting: Located on top of the nut body to apply hydraulic pressure into the sealed chamber Benefits: Improved Site Safety: Protects operators from strike or shrapnel injuries by eliminating the need for large hammers and flame cutting Reduced Downtime: Vastly reduces downtime and maintenance problems Increased Productivity: Improves productivity and achieves faster throughput without compromising product quality Enhanced Tool Life: Greatly enhances tool life and minimises collateral damage to capital equipment Repeatable Accuracy: Accuracy of the tensioning operation reduces product variation Low Level of Skill: Requires low level of skill for operation as the assembly is screwed on and removed by hand Ideal applications: Mantle Head Nut; Gyratory Crushers. See a successful installation completed by Minprovise International. Technofast Industries complete a large scope of works with Terex Jaques for all their crusher units; such as the Cedarapids Classic LJay54” Crusher.',
  '{"thread_range": "Custom to crusher shaft", "material": "Custom abrasion-resistant configuration"}'::jsonb, true, 5000, 'ezitite 유압 헤드 너트 ezitite® hydraulic head nut 자이러토리 크러셔 맨틀을 해머 없이 안전하게 장착·분리하는 유압 헤드 너트입니다. the ezitite® hydraulic head nut by technofast industries replaces standard mantle head nuts on gyratory crushers, delivering a precise and significantly safer tightening solution for the quarrying industry. ezitite hydraulic head nut technofast industries technofast 유압 너트 technofast hydraulic nuts custom to crusher shaft custom abrasion-resistant configuration')
