values ('technofast-ezitite-hydraulic-nut', 'EziTite Hydraulic Nut', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-nuts'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziTite 유압 너트', 'EziTite® Hydraulic Nut', '최대 1,000 bar에서 정밀하고 반복 가능한 동시 볼트 텐셔닝을 제공하는 특허 유압 너트입니다.', 'Technofast designs and manufactures the innovative EziTite® range of hydraulic nuts to eliminate the costly variables and unreliability of traditional torque tightening methods.', 'EziTite 유압 너트는 기존 너트를 대체해 볼트에 직접 체결되며, 유압으로 볼트를 신장한 뒤 잠금 링이 하중을 기계적으로 유지합니다. 합금강 또는 스테인리스강으로 제공되고 구면 자동 정렬 와셔와 CEJN 퀵 커플링이 기본 적용되어 정비 시간을 줄이고 안전성과 체결 정확도를 높입니다.', 'Technofast designs and manufactures the innovative EziTite® range of hydraulic nuts to eliminate the costly variables and unreliability of traditional torque tightening methods. By replacing standard hex nuts with these advanced hydraulic tensioning nuts, heavy industries can streamline complex shaft and joint tensioning configurations into a controlled, highly efficient mechanical procedure. As a global pioneer in joint integrity, Technofast provides high-performance components manufactured directly in-house, alongside our custom-design engineering services. Whether you require standard thread sizes or entirely tailored industrial dimensions, our premium product lineup is built from the ground up to deliver unparalleled precision. Engineered for Critical Industrial Loads Watch the EziTite® Hydraulic Nut demonstration video below to see our bolt tensioning technology in action! Features: Direct Axial Loading : Stretches the bolt or stud purely along its axis, completely eliminating the thread friction and dangerous torsional stress caused by manual torquing. Mechanical Lock Ring : Utilises an integrated mechanical locking collar to retain the exact pre-calculated tension firmly in place once fluid pressure is released. Low-Profile Footprint : Features a highly compact structural footprint engineered to fit easily into restricted or confined joint spaces. In-House Engineering : Manufactured to strict quality standards with customised thread profiles and high-tensile material options available on request. Benefits: Unmatched Joint Precision : Achieves ultimate load accuracy across your machinery components by bypassing up to 90% of friction losses. Improved Operator Safety : Operates via remote high-pressure hydraulic lines, keeping hands completely clear of heavy impact tools and slugging hammers. Minimised Maintenance Downtime : Fast installation, simple operation, and rapid pressure venting drastically speed up equipment assembly turnarounds. Eliminates Component Damage : Prevents expensive thread galling, scoring, and flange face damage, significantly extending the service life of your fasteners. Ideal applications: High-Vibration Environments : Secures heavy machinery joints prone to loosening from severe operational or vibrational stresses. Torsional Stress Reduction : Protects critical structural connections by completely eliminating dangerous twisting forces on the bolt thread. Frequent Maintenance Routines: Speeds up processes requiring regular, repeated adjustment or fast removal of joint nuts. Confined Spaces : Installs easily into restricted or difficult locations where standard torque tooling cannot physically fit.',
  '{"thread_range": "M24-M80 / 1-3 in", "max_force_kn": 1770.3, "max_pressure_bar": 1000, "stroke_mm": "6-20", "material": "Alloy steel or stainless steel"}'::jsonb, true, 5010, 'ezitite 유압 너트 ezitite® hydraulic nut 최대 1,000 bar에서 정밀하고 반복 가능한 동시 볼트 텐셔닝을 제공하는 특허 유압 너트입니다. technofast designs and manufactures the innovative ezitite® range of hydraulic nuts to eliminate the costly variables and unreliability of traditional torque tightening methods. ezitite hydraulic nut technofast industries technofast 유압 너트 technofast hydraulic nuts m24-m80 / 1-3 in 1770.3 1000 6-20 alloy steel or stainless steel')
