values ('technofast-ezitite-tr-high-temperature-nut', 'EziTite TR', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-nuts'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'EziTite TR 고온용 유압 너트', 'EziTite® TR High Temperature Hydraulic Nut', '550°C 이상의 고온 환경을 위한 금속 대 금속 씰 방식의 유압 너트입니다.', 'The EziTite® TR High Temp Nut is a patented, specialised tensioning device designed for simultaneous multiple bolt tensioning in high-pressure and extreme-temperature environments.', 'EziTite TR은 특허받은 금속 대 금속 씰, 컴팩트한 구조와 보조 희생 링 해제 장치를 갖춰 정유, 제철, 압력용기 및 터빈 설비의 고온 체결에 적합합니다. 여러 볼트를 동시에 균일하게 텐셔닝하며 조립·분해 시간을 단축합니다.', 'The EziTite® TR High Temp Nut is a patented, specialised tensioning device designed for simultaneous multiple bolt tensioning in high-pressure and extreme-temperature environments. It is engineered to operate reliably in conditions reaching 550°C and higher, making it suitable for applications such as refineries, steelworks, autoclaves, boilers, steam turbine half-joints, gas turbine casings, and flange makeup. The design utilizes high-pressure hydraulics to apply precise, even bolt loads with minimal physical effort, and it incorporates a unique sacrificial ring as a secondary backup release mechanism to ensure safe removal if service damage or misalignment occurs. Features: Patented Metal-to-Metal Seals : Engineered to deliver superior technical efficiency and reliable sealing performance in extreme environments. High-Temperature Resistance : Specifically built to withstand operating temperatures up to 550°C and higher. Secondary Backup Release Mechanism : Features a unique sacrificial ring that can be split and removed to allow normal retraction and safe removal in the event of service damage or misalignment. Load Loss Elimination : Designed with a smart internal configuration engineered to completely eliminate load losses during the tensioning process. Compact Footprint : Built with a compact design profile suitable for installation in confined spaces. Simultaneous Multi-Tensioning : Configured to tension multiple fasteners at the same time to ensure uniform bolt loads. Benefits: Reduced Operational Downtime : The simultaneous tensioning capability streamlines asset assembly and significantly reduces disassembly downtime. Precise Fastener Seating : Eliminating load losses ensures a precise, highly reliable fit without requiring extensive physical effort from installation crews. Enhanced Service Safety : The sacrificial ring mechanism provides a dependable extraction path, preventing tools from becoming permanently stuck or compromised due to severe thermal service damage. Cost and Technical Efficiency : The patented metal-to-metal sealing and load retention systems offer distinct technical and cost/benefit advantages over alternative tensioning devices. Application Versatility : Provides a dedicated bolting solution across critical processing and heavy industrial sectors where high thermal and pressure stress are constant variables. Ideal applications: Pressure vessel closures : Providing uniform sealing and easy extraction on heavy industrial autoclaves and boilers. Flange makeup : Ensuring precise, even bolt loads across high-pressure pipeline and equipment flanges to prevent leaks. Turbine joints : Securing critical split-line casings on both gas turbines and steam turbines where thermal movement is extreme. High-temperature applications : Operating reliably in environments reaching 550°C and higher where standard elastomeric seals would fail.',
  '{"thread_range": "M24-M80 / 1-3.5 in", "max_force_kn": 2468.6, "stroke_mm": "8-10", "temperature_range": "550°C+", "material": "High-temperature metal-to-metal seal design"}'::jsonb, true, 5030, 'ezitite tr 고온용 유압 너트 ezitite® tr high temperature hydraulic nut 550°c 이상의 고온 환경을 위한 금속 대 금속 씰 방식의 유압 너트입니다. the ezitite® tr high temp nut is a patented, specialised tensioning device designed for simultaneous multiple bolt tensioning in high-pressure and extreme-temperature environments. ezitite tr technofast industries technofast 유압 너트 technofast hydraulic nuts m24-m80 / 1-3.5 in 2468.6 8-10 550°c+ high-temperature metal-to-metal seal design')
