values ('technofast-high-pressure-air-hydraulic-pumps', 'PU-AH / PU-EH Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-pumps'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  '고압 공압·전동 유압 펌프', 'High Pressure Air Hydraulic Pumps', '2,000~4,000 bar 텐셔닝과 리프팅 작업을 위한 조립·시험 완료 공압 및 전동 펌프입니다.', 'An air hydraulic pump is a specialized compressed-air-driven power unit designed to generate extreme hydraulic pressures for industrial bolt tensioning and torque tooling.', 'Technofast 고압 펌프는 공압 구동 모델과 240V 단상 전동 모델로 제공되며 정밀 압력계, 릴리프 밸브, 보호 롤 케이지를 갖춥니다. 복동 리프팅 시스템과 FastaJac용 구성, 5 m 원격 펜던트 및 현장 맞춤형 펌핑 시스템을 선택할 수 있습니다.', 'An air hydraulic pump is a specialized compressed-air-driven power unit designed to generate extreme hydraulic pressures for industrial bolt tensioning and torque tooling. Heavy-industry operators routinely select air hydraulic pumps over manual hand pumps to execute high-volume flange tensioning with significantly faster cycle times and far less manual physical exertion. Built to operate optimally in rugged on-site conditions, this high-pressure power source delivers the consistent fluid delivery required to guarantee uniform, repeatable mechanical load retention across critical joints. Features: Premium Internal Pump Unit: Incorporates high-specification air-driven internal mechanisms for exceptionally stable pressure buildup. Stainless Steel Oil Tank : Outfitted with a corrosion-resistant steel fluid reservoir to prevent structural fluid contamination. Heavy-Duty External Roll Cage: Enclosed in a rugged steel frame that protects vital components from accidental field impacts. Safety Pressure Relief Valve : Features an integrated mechanical bypass switch to protect operators from over-pressurisation hazards. Inline Air Lubricator Assembly : Automatically feeds vital lubrication to internal air drive pistons, extending tool service life Benefits: Zero Electrical Ignition Risk: Powered completely by compressed air, eliminating dangerous electrical sparks in hazardous oil, gas, or mining zones. Minimised Maintenance Downtime : Delivers highly rapid multi-tool pressure cycles, drastically accelerating critical plant turnaround schedules. Prevents Operator Fatigue : Eradicates the gruelling physical labour of manual leverage bar pumping, promoting a safer, more productive workplace. Perfect Clamping Repeatability : Retains consistent hydraulic outputs, ensuring every interconnected stud achieves its identical pre-calculated tension. Highly Economical Power Draw : Holds maximum target pressures flawlessly without consuming extra operational energy when stalled in sequence. Technical Specifications: Ideal applications: High-Volume Flange Makeup : Speeding up complex multi-bolt tightening configurations on large structural pipe joints and industrial vessels. Hazardous Hazardous Environments : Operating safely inside explosive oil, gas, or underground mining zones where electrical power is strictly prohibited. Repetitive Plant Maintenance : Executing rapid, continuous tool pressure cycles during busy refinery or power station turnaround schedules. Powering Heavy Tensioners : Supplying stable hydraulic pressures up to 4000 bar to drive multiple interconnected EziJac bolt tensioners and EziTite hydraulic nuts.',
  '{"drive_type": "Air or 240 V electric", "pressure_range_bar": "2000-4000", "reservoir_capacity_l": "4-25", "flow_rate_lpm": "0.1-2.0", "weight_range_kg": "17.6-44.5"}'::jsonb, true, 5050, '고압 공압·전동 유압 펌프 high pressure air hydraulic pumps 2,000~4,000 bar 텐셔닝과 리프팅 작업을 위한 조립·시험 완료 공압 및 전동 펌프입니다. an air hydraulic pump is a specialized compressed-air-driven power unit designed to generate extreme hydraulic pressures for industrial bolt tensioning and torque tooling. pu-ah / pu-eh series technofast industries technofast 고압 유압 펌프 technofast high-pressure hydraulic pumps air or 240 v electric 2000-4000 4-25 0.1-2.0 17.6-44.5')
