values ('technofast-high-pressure-fittings', 'HNCP Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hoses-ancillaries'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'Technofast 고압 유압 피팅', 'Fittings', 'CEJN Series 116 커플러, 어댑터, T-블록과 5방향 매니폴드 제품군입니다.', 'High-pressure CEJN Series 116 couplings, adaptors, T-blocks and five-way manifolds.', 'Technofast 고압 피팅 제품군은 니플, 스냅 커플러, 연장 어댑터, 스위블, T-블록 및 5방향 매니폴드를 포함합니다. 1/8인치 및 1/4인치 BSP 연결과 CEJN Series 116 시스템을 지원합니다.', 'Technofast''s hydraulic fitting range includes Series 116 nipples and snap couplers, extension adaptors, BSP plugs, swivel couplers, T-blocks and five-way manifolds for connecting high-pressure bolt-tensioning systems.',
  '{"product_type": "Couplings, adaptors, swivels, T-blocks and manifolds", "max_pressure_bar": 1500, "connection": "CEJN Series 116; 1/8 and 1/4 in BSP"}'::jsonb, true, 5060, 'technofast 고압 유압 피팅 fittings cejn series 116 커플러, 어댑터, t-블록과 5방향 매니폴드 제품군입니다. high-pressure cejn series 116 couplings, adaptors, t-blocks and five-way manifolds. hncp series technofast industries technofast 호스 및 부속품 technofast hoses and ancillaries couplings, adaptors, swivels, t-blocks and manifolds 1500 cejn series 116; 1/8 and 1/4 in bsp')
