values ('technofast-liftajac', 'LiftaJac', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-lifting'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'LiftaJac 고압 유압 리프팅 잭', 'LiftaJac', '대형 하중을 동기 인양하는 컴팩트 고강도 단동·복동식 유압 잭입니다.', 'The LiftaJac is a precision-engineered hydraulic lifting system developed by Technofast Industries to deliver significant, controlled force for heavy and industrial applications.', 'LiftaJac은 고강도 합금강 본체로 높은 하중 대비 낮은 크기와 중량을 구현합니다. 단동·복동, 중공·솔리드, 단·장 스트로크 구성이 가능하며 인터링크 포트로 여러 잭을 연결해 대형 구조물을 동기 인양할 수 있습니다.', 'The LiftaJac is a precision-engineered hydraulic lifting system developed by Technofast Industries to deliver significant, controlled force for heavy and industrial applications. Built from high-strength alloy steel, its compact layout achieves an optimal load capacity while maintaining minimal physical size and a low weight-to-load ratio. Designed to replace standard manual lifting methods with fluid-pressure power, the system operates via high-pressure hydraulic cylinders driven by efficient air or electric hydraulic pump units. The LiftaJac can be tailored with customised lift heights, capacities, or specialized coatings, and is available in single or double-acting, hollow or solid, and short or long-stroke configurations to fit the specific parameters of any demanding site environment. You can download a copy of our brochure here. Features: Diverse Configurations : Available in single or double-acting configurations with a wide selection of sizes, lifting capacities, and stroke lengths. High-Strength Construction : Manufactured from high-strength alloy steel to withstand strict, repeated use in harsh operational conditions. Ergonomic Handling : Equipped with removable eye bolts or handles to ensure easy, precise positioning on-site. Advanced Materials : Built using a compact, user-friendly design that maximises lifting strength while minimizing the overall equipment weight. Integrated Protective Systems : Accompanied by air or electric pump units featuring modern safety mechanisms designed to prevent systemic overloading. Flexible Engineering : Offers customisable internal geometries (hollow or solid) alongside optional custom finishes and specialised protective coatings upon request Benefits: Operational Efficiency : Converts high hydraulic pressure into heavy-lifting capability, reducing asset downtime and streamlining complex maintenance procedures. Enhanced Site Safety : Replaces unpredictable lifting methods with controlled fluid pressure, utilizing built-in safety features to safeguard operators during high-load tasks. Broad Industry Versatility : Serves as an adaptable solution across diverse sectors, handling heavy resource maintenance on mining excavators, conveyor supporting structures, pipeline installations, offshore platforms, and power generation turbine components. Environmental Sustainability : Features energy-efficient pumps and cylinders engineered to reduce operational costs, lower carbon footprints, and support eco-friendly industrial operations. Tailored Problem Solving : Delivers exact modifications for unique challenges, allowing engineering teams to secure bespoke configurations for non-standard project requirements. Full Lifecycle Support : Backed by a comprehensive Technofast support network providing certified operator training, routine maintenance, and local technical assistance Ideal applications: HEAVY RESOURCE AND MINING OPERATIONS Heavy earthmovers : Lifting excavators, haul trucks, and loaders for servicing. Fixed plant : Maintaining crushing plant components, crusher framing, and jaw crusher tie-rods. Bulk handling : Raising conveyor belts and their supporting structures for replacement. Draglines : Lifting massive dragline parts, including buckets and booms. OIL, GAS AND OFFSHORE INFRASTRUCTURE Drilling infrastructure : Lifting drilling rig components during rig setup, takedown, or maintenance. Pipeline logistics : Sectional pipeline lifting for inspections, repairs, and installations. Wellheads : Safe lifting of wellhead components during maintenance and repair turnarounds. Offshore platforms : Handling heavy equipment servicing in harsh marine environments. POWER GENERATION FACILITIES Turbines : Lifting and inspecting turbine components in both fossil fuel and nuclear power plants. Generators : Precision positioning and handling of generator parts during overhauls. Boilers & transformers : Lifting heavy boiler sections and substation transformers for installation or mechanical repair.',
  '{"action": "Single or double acting", "construction": "High-strength alloy steel; hollow or solid", "custom_options": "Load, stroke length, finish and configuration"}'::jsonb, true, 5070, 'liftajac 고압 유압 리프팅 잭 liftajac 대형 하중을 동기 인양하는 컴팩트 고강도 단동·복동식 유압 잭입니다. the liftajac is a precision-engineered hydraulic lifting system developed by technofast industries to deliver significant, controlled force for heavy and industrial applications. liftajac technofast industries technofast 유압 리프팅 장비 technofast hydraulic lifting equipment single or double acting high-strength alloy steel; hollow or solid load, stroke length, finish and configuration')
