values ('technofast-lightweight-hand-pump', 'PU-SHP / PU-HP Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hydraulic-pumps'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  '경량 고압 수동 펌프', 'Lightweight Hand Pump', '항공 등급 경합금으로 제작된 700~1,800 bar 2단식 경량 수동 펌프입니다.', 'Technofast recommends the use of its pumps with hydraulic tensioning products. For simple applications, the lightweight Hand Pump is suggested.', '기존 강재 펌프보다 50% 이상 가벼운 고강도 경합금 펌프로, 저압에서 빠른 토출과 고압에서 효율적인 가압을 제공합니다. 진공 오일 탱크로 모든 각도에서 작동하며 조절식 릴리프 밸브, CEJN 호스와 운반 손잡이를 갖춥니다.', 'Technofast recommends the use of its pumps with hydraulic tensioning products. For simple applications, the lightweight Hand Pump is suggested. These products are made from light alloy metal that is normally used in the aviation field due to its durability and strength, and are half the weight of comparative steel-bodied pumps. Another important feature is the low handle effort required to achieve the typically high hydraulic pressures needed for bolt tensioning operations. Hand Pump Features: Double Stage. Externally adjustable low & high pressure Relief valves. Carry handle & fixing holes. Hand Pump Accessories: Roll Cage. Gauges and Gauge Adaptors. Fittings. Spare parts. Hand Pump Technical Specifications: Operator training is available and servicing of pumps supported by Technofast Industries.',
  '{"drive_type": "Manual two-stage", "pressure_range_bar": "700-1800", "reservoir_capacity_l": "1.3-2.3", "weight_range_kg": "5-10"}'::jsonb, true, 5080, '경량 고압 수동 펌프 lightweight hand pump 항공 등급 경합금으로 제작된 700~1,800 bar 2단식 경량 수동 펌프입니다. technofast recommends the use of its pumps with hydraulic tensioning products. for simple applications, the lightweight hand pump is suggested. pu-shp / pu-hp series technofast industries technofast 고압 유압 펌프 technofast high-pressure hydraulic pumps manual two-stage 700-1800 1.3-2.3 5-10')
