values ('technofast-preassembled-hydraulic-hoses', 'PU-HG Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hoses-ancillaries'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  '조립형 고압 유압 호스', 'Hydraulic Hoses and Hose Packages', '1,500 bar 작동 압력과 CEJN 커플러를 갖춘 링크·인터커넥트·T-블록 호스입니다.', 'Hydraulic Hoses and Hose Packages Hoses are essential for any high-pressure setup. Technofast offers a full range of high-performance hydraulic hoses designed to suit all industrial tensioning and lifting applications.', '광산, 건설 및 중공업 현장을 위해 완전 조립·압력 시험된 호스입니다. 단일 공구 연결부터 여러 텐셔너의 동시 작동까지 지원하도록 세 가지 커플러 구성이 제공되며, 맞춤 길이와 더 높은 압력 등급도 제작할 수 있습니다.', 'Hydraulic Hoses and Hose Packages Hoses are essential for any high-pressure setup. Technofast offers a full range of high-performance hydraulic hoses designed to suit all industrial tensioning and lifting applications. All product packages sold by Technofast are supplied fully assembled with CEJN fittings and tested ready for operation. Read more about the range of Hoses we offer. Link Hose Hose comes fitted with CEJN 1x Male and 1 x Female Coupler. → Shop our complete Hose range Inter-connect Hose Hose comes fitted with CEJN 2 x Female couplers. → Shop our complete Hose range T-Blocked Hose Hose comes fitted with CEJN 1 x Male and 2 x Female couplers. → Shop our complete Hose range Read more about the range of Hoses we offer.',
  '{"product_type": "Link, interconnect and T-block hoses", "max_pressure_bar": 1500, "burst_pressure_bar": 3000, "length_range_m": "0.9-8.0", "connection": "CEJN male/female configurations"}'::jsonb, true, 5090, '조립형 고압 유압 호스 hydraulic hoses and hose packages 1,500 bar 작동 압력과 cejn 커플러를 갖춘 링크·인터커넥트·t-블록 호스입니다. hydraulic hoses and hose packages hoses are essential for any high-pressure setup. technofast offers a full range of high-performance hydraulic hoses designed to suit all industrial tensioning and lifting applications. pu-hg series technofast industries technofast 호스 및 부속품 technofast hoses and ancillaries link, interconnect and t-block hoses 1500 3000 0.9-8.0 cejn male/female configurations')
