values ('technofast-spanners', 'Walter / TB Series', (select id from manufacturers where slug = 'technofast'), (select id from product_categories where slug = 'technofast-hoses-ancillaries'), (select id from business_areas where slug = 'bolting-torque'),
  'C-스패너 및 핀 스패너', 'Spanners: C-Spanners & Pin Spanners', '유압 너트와 텐셔너 설치용 고강도 C-스패너 및 핀 스패너 제품군입니다.', 'Technofast Industries offer a vast range of ancillary items including high-strength spanners and specialised hand tools to assist with the installation of our various Hydraulic Bolt Tensioning Products .', 'C-스패너는 직경 68~220 mm의 원형 너트와 실린더 회전에 사용합니다. 경화강 핀 스패너는 직경 6~14 mm 구멍에 대응하며 EziJac 너트 로테이터와 유압 너트 설치를 지원합니다.', 'Technofast Industries offer a vast range of ancillary items including high-strength spanners and specialised hand tools to assist with the installation of our various Hydraulic Bolt Tensioning Products . C-Spanners for Industrial Fasteners The C-Spanner is a tool used to assist with installation of round nuts, hydraulic nuts & cylinders and makes rotating the nut a simple task. The C-Spanner is available in a wide range of sizes and is a valued add-on with the purchase of EziTite Hydraulic Nuts . → Shop our complete range of industrial C-Spanners Pin Spanners & Nut Rotators The Pin Spanner is a tool used to rotate hydraulic nuts, round nuts, cylinders & nut rotators on the EziJac range of Bolt Tensioners . The Pin Spanner is made from high-quality steel and hardened to make an extremely strong bend resistant pin. → Shop our heavy-duty industrial Pin Spanners',
  '{"product_type": "C-spanners and hardened-steel pin spanners", "connection": "C-spanner diameter 68-220 mm; pin diameter 6-14 mm"}'::jsonb, true, 5100, 'c-스패너 및 핀 스패너 spanners: c-spanners & pin spanners 유압 너트와 텐셔너 설치용 고강도 c-스패너 및 핀 스패너 제품군입니다. technofast industries offer a vast range of ancillary items including high-strength spanners and specialised hand tools to assist with the installation of our various hydraulic bolt tensioning products . walter / tb series technofast industries technofast 호스 및 부속품 technofast hoses and ancillaries c-spanners and hardened-steel pin spanners c-spanner diameter 68-220 mm; pin diameter 6-14 mm')
